{"product_id":"crushed-pretty-little-liars-13","title":"Crushed (Pretty Little Liars, 13)","description":"\u003cp\u003e#1 New York Times bestselling seriesThe thirteenth book in the #1 New York Times bestselling series that inspired the hit ABC Family TV show Pretty Little Liars.High school seniors Aria, Emily, Hanna, and Spencer have been tortured by A for too long. Now they're determined to take the fight to A . . . even if it's the last thing they do. As the rest of Rosewood prepares for the prom, the girls drop everything in their hunt for A. But with each new piece of evidence, A only seems farther away. No matter how close the liars get, A is always one step ahead—and ready to crush them completely.Full of unexpected twists and shocking revelations, Crushed is the thirteenth book in New York Times bestselling author Sara Shepard’s compelling Pretty Little Liars series.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 210\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Sara Shepard\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780062199713\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45472847823001,"sku":"10RA9780062199713","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/684ff2d631bd4_Crushed__Pretty_Little_Liars__13__Sara_Shepard.jpg?v=1752084368","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/crushed-pretty-little-liars-13","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}